          <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; background: #fee2e2; color: #991b1b; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 12px; font-weight: 700;">Final Notice</span>
        </div>
        <p style="font-style: italic; margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #991b1b; line-height: 1.6;">
