        The Final Catering Package: What to Submit 14 Days Out
      </h2>
      <p>
        Exactly two weeks before your wedding date, your caterer requires a formal data submission package. Export these three reports directly from your tracking system:
      </p>
      <ol style="padding-left: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.8;">
        <li><strong>Summary Quantity Sheet:</strong> Exact aggregated entree counts (e.g., 74 Prime Beef Tenderloin, 52 Atlantic Salmon, 14 Vegan Wild Mushroom Risotto, 6 Kids Chicken Tenders, 7 Vendor Meals for DJ/Photo/Planner).</li>
        <li><strong>Table-by-Table Meal Matrix:</strong> Detailed breakdown per table (e.g., Table 1: 6 Beef, 4 Salmon; Table 2: 8 Beef, 2 Vegan), enabling banquet captains to load serving trays accurately before stepping into the dining room.</li>
        <li><strong>Medical Dietary Exception Manifest:</strong> Explicit table number, seat number, guest name, and exact allergen description for every restricted diner.</li>
      </ol>

